{"id":"uvol_nenie","lemma":"увольнение","pos":"noun","rank":4822,"glosses":["discharge, dismissal (act of expelling or letting go)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fd/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"увольнения","plural":"увольнения"},"examples":[{"text":"Том боится увольнения.","en":"Tom is afraid of getting fired.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},null]},{"text":"Извиняюсь за твоё увольнение.","en":"I'm sorry that you got fired.","words":[{"g":"to apologize","l":"извиняться"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null]},{"text":"Я могу добиться твоего увольнения.","en":"I can get you fired.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to achieve"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null]},{"text":"Кто заслуживает увольнения, так это Том.","en":"The one who deserves to be fired is Tom.","words":[{"g":"who"},null,null,{"g":"so"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"}]},{"text":"Назовите мне причину его увольнения.","en":"Tell me the reason why he was fired.","words":[{"g":"to name, to specify","l":"назвать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"him / his"},null]}]}